han expected","description":"Boeing CEO Kelly Ortberg said wing production at its Renton, Washington, factory is a hold up.","url":"https://www.cnbc.com/2026/09/16/boeing-ceo-737-max-production.html","source":"CNBC","publishedAt":"2026-09-16T19:36:24Z"}]}